  #line-at(70.02pt, 364.984pt, "Keywords:  ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.67pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(70.02pt, 394.801pt, "freestanding thin films, physical delamination, sacrificial layer etching, transfer techniques, strain ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 414.896pt, "engineering ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.67pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(70.02pt, 444.783pt, "Abstract:  ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.67pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(70.02pt, 474.658pt, "Freestanding thin films, a class of low-dimensional materials capable of maintaining structural ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 494.766pt, "integrity without substrates, have emerged as a forefront research focus. Their unique ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 514.862pt, "advantages—circumventing substrate clamping, liberating intrinsic material properties, and ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 535.016pt, "enabling cross-platform heterogeneous integration—underpin this prominence. This review ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 555.123pt, "systematically summarizes core fabrication techniques, including physical delamination (e.g., ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 575.277pt, "laser lift-off, mechanical exfoliation) and chemical etching, alongside associated transfer strategies. ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 595.385pt, "It further explores the induced strain modulation mechanisms, extreme mechanical properties and ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 615.539pt, "interface decoupling effects enabled by these films. Representative case studies demonstrate ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 635.634pt, "breakthrough applications in flexible/ultrathin electronics, ultrahigh-sensitivity sensors and the ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 655.8pt, "exploration of novel quantum states. Critical challenges regarding scalable fabrication, precise ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 675.896pt, "interface control, and long-term stability are analyzed, concluding with prospects for emerging ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 696.062pt, "applications in bio-inspired intelligent devices, quantum precision sensing, and brain-inspired ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 716.157pt, "neural networks. ")
]

