  #line-at(392.334pt, 522.482pt, "b) using transfer techniques. ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 542.578pt, "This strategy enables direct TEM observation of film planes, circumventing the viewing-angle ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 562.744pt, "constraints of conventional cross-sectional analysis. It allows direct probing of planar-view ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 582.839pt, "microstructures (e.g., grains, defects, domains, and strain fields), assessment of homogeneity, and ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 603.005pt, "supports multimodal analyses including selected-area electron diffraction, high-resolution TEM, ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 623.101pt, "scanning TEM, electron energy-loss spectroscopy, and energy-dispersive X-ray spectroscopy. ")
  #line-at(70.02pt, 651.062pt, "This technique has been extensively adopted in cutting-edge materials research. Numerous studies ")
